# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env.local.
#
# The site runs without any variable: the airport autocomplete is local and the
# trip form on /destinos ends in WhatsApp.
#
# The two variables below are only read on the server, by /api/flights/search
# (Duffel). That search is switched off in the site (FLIGHT_SEARCH_ENABLED in
# src/components/booking/BookingModal.tsx), so they are needed only if it is
# switched back on. Without DUFFEL_API_KEY the route answers with an error and
# calls nothing.

# DUFFEL_API_KEY=
# DUFFEL_ENV=

# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (format G-XXXXXXXXXX). Public identifier,
# read in the browser. Set it in Vercel (Production environment only), NOT here:
# leaving it out locally keeps development visits out of the reports.
# Without it the site loads no analytics and shows no cookie banner.
# See docs/analytics.md.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
